{{Term/Store|Sneakstrike|Sneakstrikes|Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring ability in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|Sneakstrike|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Sneakstrike|Game Screen|TotK}}</ref>

==Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Sneakstrikes can be performed by sneaking behind an enemy and attacking it while it is unaware of [[Link]]'s presence. Successfully executing a Sneakstrike will deal 8 times the damage by Link's equipped melee weapon.<ref>{{Cite|Sneak up on an enemy and unleash a melee attack to do some major damage.|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref>

==={{TotK|-}}===
A Sneakstrike can be achieved by [[Stealth|Sneaking]] up on an [[Enemy]] without being noticed, or, alternatively, by causing a [[Puffshroom]] to be hit and release a cloud of mist that hampers the vision of Enemies. This is most easily achieved by [[Fuse|Fusing]] a Puffshroom onto [[Link]]'s equipped [[Shield]].

The [[Eightfold Blade]] deals additional bonus damage from a successful Sneakstrike.

